#
# These files are the SAME corpus that 1-formats/deed/tools/deed_lint.py
# is tested against. That is the whole point of vendoring them: if this
# crate's reader and deed_lint.py disagree about any file below, one of
# the two has become a second authority over the grammar, which the DEED
# spec does not permit. The ABNF at 1-formats/deed/spec/abnf/deed.abnf
# is the sole normative grammar (owner ruling 2026-09-19, standards#837).
#
# scrambled-priority_praxis.deed is NOT from the upstream corpus. It is
# written for this crate; see its own header.
#
